{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Dreadful Gaze",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you focus your negative emotion into a lance of magical menace. Choose one creature you can see within 60 ft of you that can also you. The creature has to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failure, the creature has Disadvantage on Attack Rolls and contested Ability Checks against you for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns, the creature can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
